</div></div><div data-bgb="wysiwyg" class="bgb-wysiwyg bgb-opt--mb-small"><div data-bgt="ckeditor" data-bgt-ver="2.1.0" class="bgt-container bgt-ckeditor-container"><div class="bge-ckeditor" data-bge="ckeditor"><p>過去最高益の更新、増収増益を計画</p>
