</div></div><div data-bgb="wysiwyg" class="bgb-wysiwyg bgb-opt--mb-small"><div data-bgt="ckeditor" data-bgt-ver="2.1.0" class="bgt-container bgt-ckeditor-container"><div class="bge-ckeditor" data-bge="ckeditor"><p>コア事業（住居用・事業用賃料保証のエリア展開）</p>
